# Privacy Policy for X Location Badge

Last Updated: October 2026

Summary: X Location Badge does NOT collect, transmit, store, or sell any personal data or browsing activity. All queries are made directly from your browser to official X endpoints using your active session. All filter preferences and cached locations remain strictly on your local device.

1. Information We Collect
X Location Badge is built with privacy as a foundational principle. We do not collect any personal identifiable information (PII):
- No Browsing Tracking: We do not collect or monitor your posts, browsing history, keystrokes, or account passwords.
- No Analytics or Telemetry: We do not use Google Analytics, cookies, telemetry, or external trackers.
- No Private Servers: We do not operate external logging servers. Network requests only occur directly between your browser and official X/Twitter endpoints (x.com and twitter.com).

2. Data Handled Locally
To provide its core functionality, the extension utilizes your browser's local storage (chrome.storage.local) for:
- Location Cache: Temporarily storing public account location information so repetitive network queries are avoided.
- Filter Preferences: Saving your selected whitelist/blacklist rules, target countries, and display settings.

This data never leaves your computer and can be cleared at any time by clicking "Clear Cache" in the extension popup or by uninstalling the extension.

3. Permissions and Justifications
- storage: Required exclusively to save your local filter preferences and location cache locally on your machine.
- https://x.com/* & https://twitter.com/*: Required to inject location badges into X (Twitter) feeds, profile headers, and user hover cards, and to query public location details via X's official internal endpoints using your active authenticated session.

4. Payment Processing (Pro Subscriptions)
If you choose to purchase or subscribe to X Location Badge Pro ($2.99/month or $99 lifetime):
- Payments are processed securely via ExtensionPay and Stripe.
- We do not collect, process, or store your credit card numbers, banking info, or financial credentials. All financial transactions occur directly on Stripe's encrypted, PCI-compliant infrastructure.
- ExtensionPay securely verifies your subscription status using an anonymous user token.
- Payment data is governed by Stripe's Privacy Policy (https://stripe.com/privacy) and ExtensionPay's Privacy Policy (https://extensionpay.com/privacy).

5. Third-Party Sharing & Data Sale
We do NOT sell, rent, trade, lease, or monetize your personal data under any circumstances. We do not share data with third-party advertisers or data brokers.

6. Changes to This Policy
If our privacy practices change, we will update this document and the date above. Continued use of the extension signifies agreement to any revised terms.

7. Contact
If you have questions or concerns regarding this Privacy Policy, please reach out via the official Chrome Web Store developer support page.
